  "title": "Stephen P NDE 4240",
  "date": "'March,2006'",
  "content": "I woke up this day feeling a bit tired but nothing unusual. After my usual morning routine, I took a walk to the store for a friend. The weather was very hot that day and I was getting very weary. On the way back, I felt very weak and felt like I was going to pass out. After making it home, (barely), I gave my friend her item and said to her 'I think we might have to call 911 today.' I felt so weak that I decided to just go lay down on my bed. This is when it all started! After lying down for a bit, I started to feel really strange - my body felt like it was sort of preparing for something. My limbs started to stretch and settled back in a certain position, my whole body followed suit. Then I felt myself just drift away and leave my body. I remember that it was a most pleasant feeling. I then felt enveloped in a warm loving peaceful light. At this time I was told that it was not time for me yet, and I felt like I was kind of 'slammed' back into my physical body. After all of that I had a very bad seizure and paramedics came and were trying to bring me around, I can still remember what they were saying and doing although I was not 'awake'. I finally came around when I was in the hospital later that night. Now, as time goes by a sort of veiling process happens and things become vague. But this I will never forget! It was very, very real!!! I now have No fear of death at all. And I know that our 'spirit' does go on!",
